    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Today we are introducing Microsoft Frontier Company, a new operating business focused on delivering Frontier Transformation through AI for customers around the world.

Microsoft Frontier Company brings together a unique combination of deep industry knowledge, change management and continuous improvement experience, and enterprise-grade AI engineering expertise to help customers move from AI experimentation to measurable business outcomes.

We're making a $2.5B investment and embedding 6,000 industry and engineering experts alongside customers to co-design, deploy, and continuously improve AI systems at scale. This goes beyond traditional forward-deployed engineering models, creating what we believe will be the industry's largest and most capable outcome-driven AI engineering organization.

Click to read more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eVJSCKNf?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eVJSCKNf</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

