<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/microsoft?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Microsoft</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/microsoft-ai-for-good-lab?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Microsoft AI for Good Lab</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

